      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate, long-tenured veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners express strong gratitude for the doctors and technicians at Forest Glen, highlighting Dr. Jordan Whitfield, Dr. Gilbert, and Dr. Barichello for their warmth and skill. Reviewers note that clinical staff treat visiting pets like family members, taking time to answer all questions thoroughly during puppy wellness visits and complex surgical care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Comforting care for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently note the team's gentle manner when examining frightened or sensitive animals. Reviewers describe veterinarians getting down on the floor to examine pets that fear exam tables, as well as handling large breeds and senior dogs with patience. Owners feel reassured knowing their pets receive gentle treatment without unnecessary stress."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 5,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear explanations and treatment options"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers appreciate the thorough discussions provided by attending veterinarians regarding diagnoses and home care. Pet parents highlight that practitioners present multiple care options clearly, provide helpful informational packages for new puppies, and deliver prompt laboratory and diagnostic results following appointments."
      }
    }
  ],
